{"obsah":"<p>Unfortunately we don't often get the chance to ride exhibitions in the home town of our club, MTB &amp; Trial Mraveniště Říčany. So we were all the more eager to accept the invitation from the organisers of the Busking and Food Festival on Říčany square, and at the same time the offer to promote the Bikefestival in Tehov, which we are organising on 25/26 June. As it's a festival of street art and food, we also tested our portable sound system with a microphone, which extends our team's ability to perform even without sound provided by the organiser.</p>\n\n<p>The exhibition was ridden by Vlasta Kabeláč Čiháček and Matouš Balík, who showed the people of Říčany a slightly higher level of Trial. There was some extra egging on over volunteers and riding on the traditional steps by the church after the exhibition. Thanks to all the locals for your support :)</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2F395594aa-e418-4151-bc67-57fedea09722.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2F395594aa-e418-4151-bc67-57fedea09722.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-208997\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2F53db1053-be02-445b-9571-5a8df3880191.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2F53db1053-be02-445b-9571-5a8df3880191.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-208996\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.fir